   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> Dlt_Trigger Transmit(<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a> Tx PduId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00011\">PduInfoType</a>* PduInfoPtr)Service ID [hex] 0x41 Sync/ Async Synchronous;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Within this API , the upper layer module (called module) shall check whether the available data fits into the buffer size reported by Pdu Info Ptr - >Sdu Length. If it fits, it shall copy its data into the buffer provided by Pdu Info Ptr - >Sdu Data Ptr and update the length of the actual copied data in Pdu Info Ptr - >Sdu Length. If not, it returns E_ NOT_ OK without changing Pdu Info Ptr.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
